# Ticket packs — internal engineering records. NOT for a public repo.
# They cite consumer deployments in forensic detail (production compose contents,
# internal hostnames/ports, network names, env-file layout) and internal absolute
# paths. That is a CONSUMER's infrastructure profile, not ours to publish.
# If any of this should be public, publish a SANITISED postmortem instead — the
# engineering value (the decisions, the defect taxonomy, the verification
# discipline) survives sanitisation; the consumer's deployment details must not.
tickets/
